@* TODO (Practice 2, Step 1): Add the @page directive with two parameters:
   - category (alphabetic characters only)
   - id (integer, minimum value 1)
   Route pattern: /products/{...}/{...} *@
@* Route constraints reject non-matching URLs with a 404 before the page renders:
:alpha = letters only, :int:min(1) = integer ≥ 1. The Test URLs table shows what passes/fails. *@

@page "/products/{category:alpha}/{id:int:min(1)}"

<PageTitle>Product Detail</PageTitle>

<h1>Product Detail</h1>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">
            @* TODO (Practice 2, Step 2): Display the Category and Id parameter values below.
               Replace the ??? placeholders with the actual parameter properties. *@
            @Category -- Product #@Id
        </h5>
        <p class="card-text">
            This page demonstrates <strong>multiple route parameters</strong> with constraints.
            @*The route <code>/products/{"{category:alpha}/{id:int:min(1)}"}</code> requires:*@ 
        </p>

        <h6 class="mt-3">Test these URLs after adding your route:</h6>
        <table class="table table-sm">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>URL</th>
                    <th>Expected</th>
                    <th>Why</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>/products/electronics/42</code></td>
                    <td>Match</td>
                    <td>Alpha string + positive integer</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>/products/home-garden/42</code></td>
                    <td>404</td>
                    <td>Hyphen is not alphabetic</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>/products/electronics/0</code></td>
                    <td>404</td>
                    <td>Fails min(1) constraint</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>/products/electronics/-5</code></td>
                    <td>404</td>
                    <td>Fails min(1) constraint</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><code>/products/123/42</code></td>
                    <td>404</td>
                    <td>Digits are not alpha</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

